Package: genometranslator
Type: Package
Title: Read, Standardize and Translate Genomic Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Date: 2026-08-16
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Thierry",
    family = "Gosselin",
    email = "thierrygosselin@icloud.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
  )
Description: Reads, standardizes, validates, and translates individual genomic
    data among commonly used file formats and R data structures. A consistent
    representation of genotypes and their associated sample and marker metadata
    supports reliable exchange among genomic data workflows.
